To display the sorted list with their sugar content in grams per 100 grams, we use a `foreach` loop to iterate over the list and display the fruit name, sweetness level, and sugar content.
To determine the sweetest fruit, we simply get the last fruit in the sorted list, since it has the highest sweetness level. We then display the name, sweetness level, and sugar content of the sweetest fruit.

